!
! The suite's time (whetstone_rules.h WR4), in Trebago: the exact sum of
! its runs' milliseconds, added from the first. A run is its first try and
! at most three retries (WR5), each held to its timeout of at most an hour,
! so each run is 0 .. 14400000 ms; bad counts a run outside that and the
! total is divided by 1 - min(1, bad): refused, never added.
trebago test_ms_total
  in  ms(n)
  out total
  var bad
  bad = sum(i, min(1, max(0, 0 - ms(i))) + min(1, max(0, ms(i) - 14400000)))
  total = sum(i, ms(i)) / (1 - min(1, bad))
end
